{"catch":"方格活了過來。你能解碼未來嗎？","desc":"投入《Word Quest: Cyberpunk》這場霓虹閃爍的單字搜尋冒險吧。穿梭於一座高科技大都會，這裡有發光的街道、失控的 AI，以及隱藏的資料流。連接字母，找出加密單字，駭入層層充滿挑戰的謎題，在反烏托邦的未來世界中闖出自己的道路。每一個關卡都將帶你更深入數位地下世界——你有能力智勝系統，掌握終極程式碼嗎？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-04-30","genres":["益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2689d1fc915091267012fcf0b49ecbd3ef82520e2b6286c0969f338a6d9c3ca7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f14bd736b56e0ff8c68e7ff42d278a1867f13c6fa1421fbd6346fe1af2bf98c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54d061b42d5f1311f3c3c9cd7b28a0a226aebc851db4f4d882c97cadb45b8c5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22d10af0dea5c2b2cefcab28d88774adb4f5964bf7af8c5981e6d0131f673217.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d21fb2aac600055701e55282b05fbc03a5c84ddee948f46e984479f7987645ad.jpg"]}